+        // inlined with sltu-synthesized carry, lmul/lshl/lshr/lushr/lcmp go through
+        // C helpers (jit_l*), i2l sign-extends, l2i is free (the shared layer re-
+        // types the LSW as T_INT). lload/lstore/lconst are pure VSF + two-word
